    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01BZHwSgnGAC4LTh4wgvYJsE?thread=cmsg_01BZHwSgnGAC4LTh4wgvYJsEJednwGwKMDB1BiJTjNfxLK)_\n\nThis is the second half of #257. That PR was merged before this commit reached it.\n\nThe merge in deb409e removed the `counsel-recoll` functions from `sp-search.el`, but it kept the `R` \"Recoll\" entry in the `sp-search` transient, which `sp-search.org` no longer has. Because of that, the `tangle` check is red on `main`. This PR re-tangles the file from the doc, which removes the entry.\n\n`check-tangle.sh` passes locally (\"All tangled modules match their docs\").\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01BTsYhS2AiM2jwu2CYD5nMu)_",
